# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Shutdown test: the everyday list, then the machine is asked to halt (halt_test, 120 s into the job), to see what the kernel and
# the loader do with it. "halt_test restart 120" asks for a restart instead.
/redwood/bin/halt_test android 130
